#: lib/tuist_web/components/layout_components.ex:50
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Tuist is a build platform for engineering teams and their coding agents. It supports build and test workflows across Xcode, Gradle, Bazel, Elixir, and Rust; Struo support is in canary. Features vary by toolchain, and Rust compilation caching is experimental."
msgstr "Tuist 是為工程團隊及其編碼代理而設的建構平台。它支援 Xcode、Gradle、Bazel、Elixir 和 Rust 的建構與測試工作流程；Struo 支援處於 canary 階段。功能因工具鏈而異，Rust 編譯快取則屬實驗性質。"